rooms_desc ({"Welcome to hell =) Enjoy the toasty weather, hope you brought your sunblock O:)","You have entered into Griffon's art gallery.  On the walls you see alldifferent sorts of paintings.  I'n the far corner of the room is whereGriffon does all of her art works.  Above the drawing table there hangpictures of dragons, faeries, X-men, and heros.  Scatered in the cornerare many pens, pencils, paints and papers.  On the east wall is a fish tank.  There is another chandiler hanging from the ceiling.The room is a suptle burgande colour.  The carpet is white.","You have entered Griffons private bed chamber. There is a queen sized sleigh bed on the north wall covered in a dark green comforter and manyfeather pillows. Next to the bed is a round table that has a candlabraon it, so that Griffon can read in bed. The large dresser is where she doesher make-up. There are 3 chairs here, just incase she invites someone upto talk infront of the large fireplace. In the far corner there is a screen behind which, Griffon dresses. The walls are painted a pale yellowwith little blue fluer-des-lis placed evenly at intervals. The lower partof the wall is wooden, and the floor is covered in a thick, soft, white shag carpet.","This is the room where you can normally find Griffon and Morrolan if they are at home.  The room is painted in a briliant red colour and thefloor is covered with a fine velvatine red carpet to match.  A sofa,love seat, and chair sit around a small coffee table.  The contrast ofthe black leather furniture makes the room look very modern, and in fact, it is.  There is a big screen TV off on the south wall next to the only window in the room.  Beautiful black silk drapes hang on the window.  Thereis a large knick-nack shelf on the north wall, here there are all sortsof collectables.  A large book shelf sits on the west wall, and houses many fine novels and historical books.  From the ceiling hangs a largeover-head fan, that can be turned on to cool the room in the summertimeor any other time it might get hot in here.  ","This is Griffon's solarium, here, she can look out the huge glass windowand watch the animals go by in the forest beyond and watch her roses grow in her garden.  Sunlight pours in from the window to light the roomand it seems to shine into the room to the west.  There is a finewicker set with bright green cushion's set about the room to sit on.There is a coffee table in the middle of the room, you think perhaps this is where Griffon entertains guests in the summer time.  On the wall opposite the windows, there is a copy of Monet's Water Lily's hanging.A small book shelf, houses many novels, nick-nacks, and a pictureof Griffon's boy friend.  Flowers sent the room from vases all over theroom.  The floor is made of finest mahogany wood and the walls are covered with a bright floweral paper.","You have entered into Griffon's entertainment room.  In the far cornerstands a gaint big screen TV with a sega genesis hooked up to it, gamesscater the floor. On the east wall stands a pinball machine, a dart board, and a Street Fighter II Super Turbo machine.  On the west wall sits a Mortal COmbat II machine for when Mark and Matt come over to visit.The center of the room is taken up by a pool table and the couch thatsits in front of the TV.  There is a VCR on top of a sterio rack system.  There is a whole shelf system full of CD's, tapes, and VCR tapes in the corner beside the sterio on the north wall.  There hangs a ceiling lightover the pool table much like in a pool parlor.  The walls are coveredwith posters of different musical groups.  The floor is covered by a nice thick, blue shag carpet.","You have entered into the dinning room.  A huge 14 seat rectangular tabletakes up most of the room.  The table is always set, just incase companyshows up at the last minute.  The table is covered in a fine linen clothand fine china and silverware are placed perfectly on the table.  MaybeGriffon has a house keeper?  I beautiful candleabra sitts in the middle of the table.  Though, there is also a chandalier hanging from the ceiling.The room its self is as dark as most of the rest of the house, it is painted a deep purple colour, and even the carpet is purple!!  The onlylight in the room comes from the 2 light sorces and the white table cloth.","This is the chateau's only bathroom.  You'd think that there would beat least one more for such a large house, but there isn't.   The room its self is very large and houses a queen sized hot tub.The hot tub is hiden under a wooden window area.  There is also a bath tuband shower in plain sight.  Of course there is the toilet and the sink, these are seperated from the rest of the room by a wooden door and dividing wall.  Griffon seems to have kept this room very simple in colours, for the room is a pale light blue colour.  Towels and carpetsare the exact same colour as the walls, and seem to blend in, almost hiding themselves.  A large floor length mirror hangs on the main door, to check your clothing before you leave.","This is Griffon's ENORMOUS kitchen.  Cabinets cover every wall in here, youtend to wonder if she's got enough space in here.  The sink sits undera large window, and the microwave hangs under a cabinet.  There is a largeisland that houses the stove burners.  There is a double oven on thewest wall and a pantry on the east wall.  The fridge is one of those computerised ones that makes ice and all that junk, its over on the south wall.  The room is a basic white, and the floor is covered in a softblue and white lanolium floor.","HI",})
